      "url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1053811926004672?dgcid=rss_sd_all",
      "title": "Unveiling the brain\u2019s spatio-temporal processing of salt habituation using high-density EEG",
      "content": "<p>Publication date: 1 October 2026</p><p><b>Source:</b> NeuroImage, Volume 339</p><p>Author(s): Thibault Chabin, Lucie Ben-Sussan, Thierry Thomas-Danguin, Charlotte Sinding</p>",
      "author": "",
      "published_date": null,
      "source": "Neuroimage",
      "status": "pending",
